      "text": "Network primitives:\n  MAC  (many → one):   X₁ ─┐\n                            ├──[Channel]──> Y\n                       X₂ ─┘\n  BC   (one → many):        ┌──> Y₁\n                   X ──────┤\n                            └──> Y₂\n  IC   (two pairs):   X₁ ──> Y₁ (+ interference from X₂)\n                      X₂ ──> Y₂ (+ interference from X₁)\n  Relay:             X ──[Channel]──> Z (relay) ──> Y\n                      └──────────────────────────> Y"
