      "text": "Constraints:\n  R₁       ≤ I(X₁; Y | X₂)          ← X₁ alone vs Y, X₂ known\n  R₂       ≤ I(X₂; Y | X₁)          ← X₂ alone vs Y, X₁ known\n  R₁ + R₂  ≤ I(X₁,X₂; Y)            ← sum rate constraint"
    },
