      },
      "text": "**Achievability**: Random coding + joint typicality decoding. Each user encodes at rate Rᵢ.\nDecoder finds unique (m₁,m₂) jointly typical with received Y. Error → 0 iff interior of\ncapacity region."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-NETWORK-INFORMATION-THEORY.md#014",
      "path": [
        "06-NETWORK-INFORMATION-THEORY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:information-theory:06-network-information-theory, git-history:information-theory:06-network-information-theory]",
