        "section": "information-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Network Information Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MAC with SIC: R₁ + R₂ = I(X₁X₂;Y) ≥ max{I(X₁;Y), I(X₂;Y)}"
    },
    {
