      "text": "**Gaussian MAC**: X₁ ~ N(0,P₁), X₂ ~ N(0,P₂), Y = X₁ + X₂ + Z, Z ~ N(0,N₀)\n```\n  R₁ + R₂ ≤ ½ log(1 + (P₁+P₂)/N₀)    (sum capacity)\n  R₁      ≤ ½ log(1 + P₁/N₀)\n  R₂      ≤ ½ log(1 + P₂/N₀)\n```\nSIC achieves sum capacity: decode weaker user first, subtract, decode stronger user."
    },
